Package: nemo-folder-preview
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-gi, python3-pil, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, nemo, mint-themes
Description: Photo folder previews for Linux Mint Cinnamon and Nemo
 Nemo Folder Preview generates photo previews inside Mint-Y folder icons
 in the Nemo file manager. It supports one to four images, including
 WebP, and follows the active Mint-Y icon theme.
